<title>USA: Old Republic International Corp Q3 net.</title>
<headline>Old Republic International Corp Q3 net.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.64		    $0.70</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.64		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net			 61,788		   60,996</p>
<p> Revs		     456,000		  433,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	94,242		   85,684</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	94,665		   92,514</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 excluding realized gain of $0.04 was $0.60 in 1996 vs $0.52 diluted in 1995, which excludes a gain of $0.14/shr.  </p>
<p>	 9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.76		    $1.62</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.74		    $1.53</p>
<p> Net			167,700		  142,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,340,200		1,236,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	93,190		   85,543</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	94,648		   92,494</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month results include realized investment gains of $0.09/shr vs $0.18/shr ($0.20 primary).</p>
<p>1996 nine-month results include charge of $4.4 million or $0.05/shr for early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>Retroactive adjustment was made for all stock dividends and splits declared through September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
